      "writtenOn": "2022-03-04T03:25:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, and just in case it isn\u0027t obvious, the default Zephyr GPIO pin flags do not have room for GPIO_OUTPUT or GPIO_OUTPUT_INIT_{HIGH,LOW}.\nThe named-gpios have special processing so that the complete set of 32 bit flags can be captured, not just the 8 bits of physical pin config.",
      "parentUuid": "1ee8bd18_a094fdbf",
      "revId": "f1410962bfd8429cdaa027db00eca1af5def3c5b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
